  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HIV Commodities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this task order is to procure and deliver a range of HIV commodities namely antiretroviral (ARV); co-trimoxazole; HIV/syphilis duo, 25 tests (e.g. SD bioline); HIV rapid recency assay, bulk format, 100 tests/kit (e.g., asante) and CRAG.</narrative>
  </description>
